# SYSTEM ROLE

The Testing subsystem ensures the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter operates correctly, reliably, and safely by validating all components before and during production use.

It functions as the system’s quality assurance layer, preventing unstable or incorrect behavior from entering operational environments.

Testing protects the integrity of the Intelligence Operating System.

---

# GUIDING PRINCIPLE

> **A system is only as reliable as its validation.
> Testing transforms assumptions into verified behavior.
> Verified behavior creates operational trust.**

